## Brand attributes

> Exactly 3–5. Each attribute must have a concrete UI implication. Ask: "If a designer made a decision that contradicts this attribute, what would it look like?" That is the test.

| Attribute | What it means for UI |
|---|---|
| << attribute >> | << concrete UI expression — not a vague adjective >> |
| << attribute >> | << concrete UI expression >> |
| << attribute >> | << concrete UI expression >> |

