## Constraints

**Tech stack:**
<< Framework, styling approach, component library if any. Be specific about versions that affect UI decisions. >>

**Platforms and breakpoints:**
<< Which devices / screen sizes are in scope? Which are out of scope? >>

**Accessibility baseline:**
<< WCAG level, keyboard nav requirement, screen reader testing requirement. >>

**Known out-of-scope items:**
<< What is explicitly NOT a UI responsibility for this product? >>

**Performance budget:**
<< Any known time-to-interactive, bundle size, or animation budget constraints? >>
